# armour/woman/leather_hang: the leather skirt tabs (the woman's, the same tabs) over the tunic's skirt (P2c slice, SLICE-ARMOUR; LADDER-ARMOUR adds the
# finish regions, STYLE_P2 27.3): two boiled tabs lit at the top-left over the tunic's cloth; studs `when studs`.
# Finish regions: R the tabs' hem row, N the split between the tabs, W a spot on the shadow tab.
# Keys: the hang channel in D U R L (wide and flare open over the stride). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (FORGE-LIMBS envelope r1) T5-T6 skirt flare (STYLE_P2 29.3): `armour.t5` views facing D/U, 1 px more past the hips on the lower half; flared copies of the replace views go before them. Generated by FORGE-LIMBS flare.py.
use person
body woman
role armour leather
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

